{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_title", "source_sha256": "280aff026d5528f1d037320be9716f7b3c54b8cfc505145a5c64caed0074f13d", "ja": "真美と舞台裏", "zh": "和真美的后台之行", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f5dbd47ffebfd4c431fd1ac10e7db8d7b46500f564577352a0b573fb9ca05cf6", "ja": "真美との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是和真美在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a5c6f575fcbadb8d67aee510beccf5c252b73f830f2119e9c09053530bef0e0d", "ja": "真美、お疲れ様。さっきのステージ、真美らしい\n楽しさがいっぱいのステージになってたぞ！", "zh": "真美，辛苦了。刚才的舞台，充满了真美风格的欢乐呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "da1e1db0b34657211d6d72937859aa1366f919d1c015d6ec81441d845fd319fe", "ja": "あ、兄ちゃん！　やっぱ兄ちゃんもそう思った？\nえへへ、それでこそ真美の兄ちゃんだよ！", "zh": "啊，哥哥！果然哥哥也这么觉得吗？\n嘿嘿，这才是我的哥哥嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "6dd80fc94ab453f2a1d22e778f2a6504eecb7b352897a46c1513e2148f459e69", "ja": "ファンの兄ちゃん姉ちゃん達が、目をキラキラさせて\n真美を求めてくるもんだからさ～。", "zh": "因为粉丝哥哥姐姐们都眼睛闪闪地期待着真美嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "f11c59641ad44e72b9c7d1be00662ce898c8daed9630aa9fbd4450b05f524193", "ja": "真美もついつい期待に応えちゃうんだよね♪\nほら、ファンサは大事っしょ？", "zh": "真美也会不由自主地回应大家的期待嘛♪\n你看，和粉丝互动很重要，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1bab5ff33560b4881f78e46249bcb8249b9712f08ce73f46193fb6c3de810901", "ja": "ああ、みんなを楽しませて輝くのが真美だからな。\nアイドルとして立派だったぞ。", "zh": "啊，让大家开心、闪耀光芒，这就是真美啊。\n作为偶像，你表现得很出色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "d14f6c1a65b5f4da726d79560abbb5224af0154ba5d17be301e09c4882101aaa", "ja": "に、兄ちゃん……。どしたの、なんか今日はやけに\nホメてくれるけど。なんか美味しいもの食べた？", "zh": "哥、哥哥……怎么了？你今天怎么特别爱夸人啊。难道吃了什么好吃的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1006_p", "source_sha256": "01cb61d2ecc9c8b10d5c6e58959b87fad0078f4265b62fed3755c2fcd76ec59d", "ja": "はは、そうじゃないよ。\nただ、ほら……。", "zh": "哈哈，不是那样的。\n只是，你看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1007_audience", "source_sha256": "30bf1663a396427ca8b637e3b48d0fbf20a8b325c27db2cddd9d3fbd2ab7c5c7", "ja": "わああああああ！！！！\nまみちゃーん！　まみちゃーん！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！\n真美——！真美——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b385418e84ccd465967e42e1e3c4148b3e2bff2aaae9163cd5c130941b738b6d", "ja": "ファンの声が教えてくれてるんだ。\n真美のステージが素晴らしかった、また会いたいって。", "zh": "粉丝们的声音告诉我，真美的舞台非常精彩，他们还想再见到你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "75fc2f1f815aa395aeb10754dfccdd2ee6a80b11602955e04f0c33622f0e315b", "ja": "えへへ、そっかー。\nまあ、みんな喜んでくれてるのはわかってたけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，这样啊。\n不过，我知道大家都很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "bc9f807c63dc3b788e5e5a9d53b53559a6b4bacaf373094babd9aecb7170bf46", "ja": "でも、こんなにメッチャ喜んでもらえると……。\nやっぱうれしいね、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "不过，能让大家这么开心……果然还是很高兴啊，哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1012_p", "source_sha256": "931f7a4b6f9760c9cb3cf2669c13c9ccff3403834ecf548e288fdaa5235e6261", "ja": "ああ、俺も嬉しいよ。真美がしっかり輝いたことも、\nそれがお客さんに届いたことも。", "zh": "啊，我也很高兴。真美能尽情绽放光彩，\n这份光彩也能传达给客人们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "db5b695d1c4364dbad7be0564ff4a4d7080a0c740c176dc5ab5bdcfb7877a1bf", "ja": "よーし……決めた。なんか今さらだけど決めたよ！\n兄ちゃん、真美はトップアイドルになる！", "zh": "好——……决定了。虽然有点事到如今才说的感觉，不过真美决定了！\n哥，真美要成为顶尖偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8d1fd96ed2f5519506268049ba2a46b00351370f6bda3d8a51b59f25ee0b59bd", "ja": "……わかった。俺もそのつもりでプロデュースする！\nただ、まだ今日のライブは終わってないぞ。", "zh": "……我明白了。我也会抱着这样的决心去制作你的！\n不过，今天的演出可还没结束呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b2876f2efd7582d583e7a9871bfaf610938c07cd2bd89a5ed10ccb2a44897933", "ja": "まずは今日のライブを……\nこの会場を、最高に盛り上げてくれ！", "zh": "首先要让今天的演出……\n让这个场馆的气氛，彻底嗨到最高潮吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "7692c3d0e688197e165327dac0d032788a193d76af8f81ebc87de246b4c8953a", "ja": "わかったよー！　この会場も兄ちゃんのハートも、\n真美がまるっと全部、モリモリに盛り上げるかんね！", "zh": "包在真美身上——！整个会场还有老哥的心，\n真美都会统统给你炒得超～级火热的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_012mam_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "db96eb02e276e121774930f1ddeba8562cd3e62b67f3d1e88a687f6fa8d0feba", "ja": "……あ。ちなみに、真美がトップアイドル宣言したの、\n亜美には内緒だよ？　真美と兄ちゃんだけの秘密ね♪", "zh": "……啊。顺便说一句，真美要成为顶级偶像这件事，可要瞒着亚美哦？这是只有真美和哥哥知道的秘密♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
